#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.map.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.map"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_:1 of
msgid "Apply func element-wise to every value in the LiteFrame."
msgstr "对 LiteFrame 中的每个值逐元素应用 func。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_:3 of
msgid ""
"Each cell is transformed independently by ``func``; the output has the "
"same shape and column names as the input.  Output dtypes are inferred by "
"mocking ``func`` on a sample value per column unless ``dtype`` is "
"supplied or ``skip_infer`` is set."
msgstr ""
"每个单元格由 ``func`` 独立转换；输出具有与输入相同的形状和列名。除非提供"
"了 ``dtype`` 或设置了 ``skip_infer``，否则通过在每列的样本值上模拟 ``func"
"`` 来推断输出数据类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_ of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_:8 of
msgid ""
"Function to apply to each element.  If ``func`` is a class, it is "
"instantiated once per chunk, ``__call__`` is invoked per element, and "
"``close()`` (if defined) is always called at the end of the chunk."
msgstr ""
"应用于每个元素的函数。如果 ``func`` 是一个类，则每个分块实例化一次，对"
"每个元素调用 ``__call__``，并在分块结束时始终调用 ``close()``（如果已定义"
"）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_:14 of
msgid "If 'ignore', null values are propagated without calling func."
msgstr "如果为 'ignore'，则在不调用 func 的情况下传播空值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_:16 of
msgid "Output dtype applied to all columns."
msgstr "应用于所有列的输出数据类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_:18 of
msgid "If True, skip mock inference when dtype is not provided."
msgstr "如果为 True，则在未提供 dtype 时跳过模拟推断。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_:20 of
msgid "Positional arguments forwarded to func."
msgstr "转发给 func 的位置参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_:22 of
msgid ""
"Keyword arguments. '_check_output_dtype' is popped for output validation;"
" all others are forwarded to func."
msgstr ""
"关键字参数。'_check_output_dtype' 被弹出用于输出验证；所有其他参数都"
"转发给 func。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_ of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_:25 of
msgid ""
"Lazy LiteFrame with the same shape as the input, where each value is the "
"result of applying ``func`` to the corresponding input cell. Call "
"``.execute()`` to materialize."
msgstr ""
"具有与输入相同形状的惰性 LiteFrame，其中每个值都是将 ``func`` 应用于相应"
"输入单元格的结果。调用 ``.execute()`` 以实例化。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_ of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_:32 of
msgid ":py:obj:`apply`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_:33 of
msgid "Apply a function per column or per row."
msgstr "按列或按行应用函数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_:35 of
msgid ":py:obj:`transform`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_:36 of
msgid "Transform per column or per row."
msgstr "按列或按行转换。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_:39 of
msgid "示例"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.map.map_:49 of
msgid "Specify an explicit output dtype with ``dtype``:"
msgstr "使用 ``dtype`` 指定明确的输出数据类型："


